country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>GOTOH, MASATO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ITO, TAKEKAZU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MURATA, HIROKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SASAKI, SHIZUO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOSHIZAKI, KOUJI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An internal combustion engine wherein a first type of combustion in which the EGR gas quantity in a combustion chamber (5) is greater than the EGR gas quantity at which the soot production rate is at peak, producing little soot, or a second type of combustion in which the EGR gas quantity in the combustion chamber (5) is smaller than the EGR gas quantity at which the soot production rate is at peak is selectively effected.  At the time of switching between the first and second types of combustion, the injection timing is delayed until after the upper dead point of compression is reached.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un moteur à combustion interne dans lequel on effectue sélectivement un premier type de combustion caractérisé par un volume de recirculation des gaz de carter dans la chambre de combustion (5) supérieur au volume de recirculation de ces gaz auquel le taux de production de suie est au maximum, pour une faible production de suie, et un second type de combustion caractérisé par un volume de recirculation des gaz de carter dans la chambre de combustion (5) inférieur au volume de recirculation du premier type de combustion correspondant au taux de production de suie maximum. Au moment de la transition entre le premier type et le second type de combustion, on diffère l'injection jusqu'à ce que l'extrémité supérieure de la compression soit atteinte.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>